essor of Educational Studies View Bio Sorenson, Steven Adjunct Instructor of Political Science and Pre-Law Advisor View Bio Stephan, Charles Adjunct Instructor of Music: Cello & Bass View Bio Stephan, Ann Adjunct Instructor of Music: Violin & Viola View Bio Stepleton, Ian Adjunct Instructor of Journalism View Bio Thompson, Paul Assistant Professor of Music and Chair of Music View Bio Thompson, David Adjunct Instructor of Music View Bio Topal, Sedef Assistant Professor of Political Science View Bio Unger, Mary Professor of English and Associate Dean for Academic Affairs View Bio Wallace, Robert Professor of Biology Emeritus View Bio Wang, Yuan Assistant Professor of Political Science View Bio Wesner ’21, Callista Adjunct Instructor of Exercise Science View Bio Willoughby, Patrick Professor of Chemistry, the Oyster Family Distinguished Professorship in Chemistry, and Coordinator of Faculty Research and Creative Achievement, Chair of Chemistry and Co-Director of the Biomedical Science program View Bio Wittler, George \"Skip\" Professor Emeritus of Biology, Director of Ceresco Conservancy View Bio Zhang, Jiahang Visiting Assistant Professor of Economics View Bio Zhang, Fan Associate Professor of Business Management View Bio Exemplary Faculty Endowed chairs and professorships are among the highest honors Ripon College can bestow upon its faculty. Endowed Professors Quick Links MyRipon Portal Red Hawks Athletics Lane Library Make a Gift Admissions Request Information Visit Apply Resources Campus Map Course Catalog Connect With Us Jobs at Ripon Consumer Information Ripon College 300 W. Seward St. Ripon, WI 54971 P: 920-748-8115 E: [email protected] Copyright © 2026. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy ."
