ek Student Life Overview Overview Living in Ripon Housing & Dining Living Options Ripon College Dining Clubs & Activities Clubs and Organizations Greek Life ROTC Center for Diversity and Inclusion Esports Campus Services Health and Wellness Parking and Transportation Campus Safety Resources MyRipon Portal Harassment/Title IX Bias Related Incident Protocol Hazing News & Events News News Media Contact Events Events Calendar Plan your event Fine Art Events Arts Events Music Events Theatre Events Ceremonies & Special Events Welcome Week Catalyst Day Commencement Alumni Weekend Family Weekend and Homecoming Publications Publications Athletics Dean's List Registrar Dean’s List Transcripts Four-Year Graduation Guarantee At the end of each semester, students who have earned a 3.40 average or better are placed on the Dean’s List. In order to qualify for the Dean’s List a student must complete 12 credits of regular grade work (work graded A, B, C, etc), and may have no U (unsatisfactory) or I (incomplete). The Dean’s List is posted online so that media representatives can quickly access the names of local students for publication. The list is sorted by state, and Wisconsin names are further sorted by county. The list also provides students’ hometowns. For questions or concerns, please contact the Office of the Registrar . Spring 2026 Dean’s List DO MORE YOUR WAY Become the extraordinary individual you are meant to be at Ripon. Areas of Study Experiential Learning Centers and Resources Quick Links MyRipon Portal Red Hawks Athletics Lane Library Make a Gift Admissions Request Information Visit Apply Resources Campus Map Course Catalog Connect With Us Jobs at Ripon Consumer Information Ripon College 300 W. Seward St. Ripon, WI 54971 P: 920-748-8115 E: [email protected] Copyright © 2026. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy ."
